sue post \"NoNormalDev linked a pull request that will close this issue\"), and another one isn't nessecary. But if you're looking for a first contribution, I can tell you that `PacketPeerUDP.set_dest_address()` is missing the exact same check. Whishing you good luck!\n\nsounds good can I link the pr to this issue?\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4848808994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4851158985","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120521#issuecomment-4851158985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120521","id":4851158985,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABISbPyQ","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-01T06:53:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T06:53:23Z","body":"\n> sounds good can I link the pr to this issue?\n\nI'd create a new one","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4851158985/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5507404094","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120521#issuecomment-5507404094","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120521","id":5507404094,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSERRPg","user":{"login":"Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T09:26:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T09:28:38Z","body":"As mentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120522#pullrequestreview-5087689477, this is a problem that's not specific to the `listen()` methods, but applies to all Godot APIs that declare an integer parameter different from `int64_t` (== GDScript `int`).\n\nTake even something obvious like [`StreamPeer::put_u8`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_streampeer.html#class-streampeer-method-put-u8): since GDScript only has `int`, you can pass `-1` and who-knows what happens. But in GDExtension and C#, you **cannot** pass `-1` without compiler warning/error, as the parameter is declared as `uint8_t`.\n\nThe problem is that there's currently nothing in GDScript that validates arguments to fit into the declared type. Yes, GDScript only has `int`, but that doesn't mean it needs to silently truncate values -- it could emit a runtime error/warning if a conversion loses information. But more importantly, APIs **should not** take `int64_t` to work around this GDScript limitation.\n\nAs I see it, this would require a deeper investigation of where exactly in the GDScript or function-dispatch logic this silent conversion occurs, and if it can be addressed for all such parameters. Then `UDPServer`/`TCPServer` wouldn't even need to be touched.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5507404094/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5763073783","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120521#issuecomment-5763073783","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120521","id":5763073783,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABV4GG9w","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T15:31:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T15:31:05Z","body":"The conversion probably happens in the core MethodBind templates through implicit conversion from `Variant`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5763073783/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]